    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d814">

                <pb facs="0675" n="559" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg559"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/12717.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Carothers
                        to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gomez Palacio</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 9, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>. I have the honor to enclose herewith a
                    memorandum of the agreement arrived at between Mr. Carranza and General Villa.
                    This was given me by General Villa, and contains all but two of the clauses. The
                    two that are not included refer to General Angeles and to the railroad
                    situation.* * *</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">G. C. Carothers</hi></signed>.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d814-a1.xml" xpointer="d814-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
